\ Regression for the jitNativeWordCall leaf-call fix. This is a smaller
\ version of the Fibonacci native-fallback repro: `.` reaches
\ `inspect`, and `+` inside `[ swap over + ] dip` are both generic natives
\ that route through `jitNativeWordCall` under AOT. Both must still produce
\ correct results now that the function reads its dispatch id, stack
\ effect, and function pointer from a leaf cache populated once at process
\ startup, instead of doing a per-call dictionary lookup.

fib-step: ( a b n -- result ) [
  dup 0 = [ drop drop ] [
    1 - [ swap over + ] dip fib-step
  ] if
] ;

fib: ( n -- n ) [
  dup 2 < [ ] [
    0 1 <rot- fib-step
  ] if
] ;

10 fib .
